#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- a developer [documentation](https://dev.ansel.photos/) to help contributors avoid\n"
"  reverse-engineering the code and to help long-term maintenance,\n"
"- automatic [camera support](./resources/supported-cameras.md) updates,\n"
"- [many other automation tools](./contribute/workflows.md) to help maintainability and\n"
"  debugging,\n"
"- a much reduced [code complexity](https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel#code-analysis),\n"
"- a written [design protocol](./contribute/design.md) and\n"
"  [triage rules](./contribute/triaging.md), so decisions can be checked instead of guessed.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:82
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"All this may sound cryptic to most users. It just means the maximum was made to help\n"
"stability and debugging, even for contributors who are not familiar with the code base,\n"
"therefore reducing the [bus factor](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bus_factor).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: content/donate.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can be a part of that"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:88
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The kind of individuals that have the professional skills mentionned above tend to find\n"
"well-payed and stable job opportunities. If they are already practicing their skills\n"
"professionally all week long, chances are they want to rest from them on the spare time.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"That's _very_ bad news for open-source/libre applications because it means they are left\n"
"with random contributions from amateurs, resulting in a long-known problem: open-source\n"
"applications are the half-baked, lower-end alternatives to their commercial counterparts,\n"
"being open somehow making it tolerable to a minority of users who value privacy over\n"
"getting their job done.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:98
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"__Open-source needs to pay well to attract skilled engineers, in order to produce\n"
"industry-grade applications__. It's really not rocket science: people need to pay their\n"
"bills first. Then perhaps work on cool stuff if they can. Not the other way around.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:103
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"__By financing Ansel, you are making it possible for the maintainer to put the required\n"
"time on fixing things properly and on solving your actual problems, without having to live\n"
"in financial stress.__ You are also giving other engineers incentives to do the same in\n"
"other projects by demonstrating it is possible.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:106
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"__You are contributing to a culture of fair work retribution in open-source__, which too\n"
"often relies on exploiting free labour and precariat.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/donate.md:108
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can donate through [Liberapay](https://liberapay.com/jiyone/donate).\n"
msgstr ""

