msgid "New here and already annoyed"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:21
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The original address was `https://community.ansel.photos/view-discussion/new-here-and-already-annoyed`.\n"
"You can check this copy against the [snapshot in the Internet Archive](https://web.archive.org/web/20250519012344/https://community.ansel.photos/view-discussion/new-here-and-already-annoyed).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Posted by **Magnus Berg** on 2025-04-24.*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "I found Ansel yesterday, downloaded an app image, and clicked around a bit.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "I sympathized with the developer's ideas. I think Darktable has become too cluttered.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:34
#, no-wrap
msgid "I decided today to start providing financial support. I went in and paid 30 euros (5 per month). There were already TWO payment options, and I chose Librapay.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "When I went to check out my Ansel Community account, I discovered that you can become a premium member there. I wish I had been informed of this a little earlier. I would obviously have chosen a premium membership for 5 euros per month rather than just donating. So now I feel cheated.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "But I really hope that Ansel develops well and that I get value for the donation I have made so far, even if I don't get access to what would have been included in a premium membership.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:42
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Steve** — 2025-04-24\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "I concur. I have been hopping AP would clean up the donation process.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "Don't let it hold you back, Ansel will be the GOAT.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Jon** — 2025-04-30\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "What's the difference between premium membership and simply donating? I suspect continued access to Ansel and personal satisfaction of having contributed to the cause in the best way you can are the benefits either way.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Magnus Berg** — 2025-04-30\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:58
#, no-wrap
msgid "The difference between standard and premium is another complication regarding donations that requires an answer. Would anyone like to answer that question?\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:60
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then, of course, as a donor, you don't want to feel cheated. Therefore, it naturally feels better to get something in return for your donation compared to those who don't donate.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:64
#: content/community/order-of-operations.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Jon** — 2025-05-01\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "I happened across one benefit of premium membership in Help & Rules. \"Free users get a total storage of 256 MB for all their uploads. Premium users have unlimited storage space. Image files should be limited to a resolution of 2048×2048 px, and encoded in JPG at quality 85 (this is a guideline that will not be enforced, just use your best judgment here).\"\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Magnus Berg** — 2025-05-01\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/new-here-and-already-annoyed.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Thanks for that, Jon. After your explanation, I realize that my loss was negligible.\n"
msgstr ""

