#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:30
#, no-wrap
msgid "Hello all!\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:32
#, no-wrap
msgid "I was wondering if people wouldn't mind sharing how they assess a collection of new photos for which to work on further? (commonly called culling, but I will omit this term to avoid confusion with the removed \"Culling\" mode)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:36
#, no-wrap
msgid "Personally, the most intuitive approach would be able to view each photo in a full screen, and then with keyboard shortcuts rate/reject photos, and move onto the next.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "This almost works out-of-the-box in Ansel, but there's a quirk with photo selection.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "The rating/reject shortcuts work on the \"Selected\" image (shown with a light grey highlight), however arrow keys do not change this \"Selected\" image they merely move the \"cursor\" to other images, at which point they can be selected with \"Space\".\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:44
#, no-wrap
msgid "This leads me to use this workflow currently:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:46
#, no-wrap
msgid "1\\. Adjust Lighttable to view 1 photo per row, press tab to remove panels.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "2\\. Rate/reject/color the photo\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:50
#, no-wrap
msgid "3\\. Press Space to unselect it\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:52
#, no-wrap
msgid "4\\. Move to the next photo with Right\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:54
#, no-wrap
msgid "5\\. Press Space to select it\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid "6\\. Repeat from step 2\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:62
#, no-wrap
msgid "This is fairly cumbersome, and I do not like that if I've made a mistake with my Space select/unselect dance, I can end up with some other photo silently selected in the background and then I am performing invisible rating/rejection edits to it without realising.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:66
#, no-wrap
msgid "Please let me know if I'm missing something here, or any alternative approaches people have.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/culling-rating-images-workflow.md:72
#, no-wrap
msgid "Joshua\n"
msgstr ""

