msgid "Building Ansel on Windows 11 with msys2 and with Bitdefender "
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:20
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The original address was `https://community.ansel.photos/view-discussion/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2`.\n"
"No crawler ever captured this particular thread, so the text below — taken straight from the forum database — is the only copy left.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Posted by **PhG44** on 2024-03-28.*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid "Depuis les dernières mises à jour, mon antivirus \"Bitdefender Total Security\" considère un fichier comme infecté et me le bloque, résultat je n'arrive plus à compiler Ansel . (remarque je n'ai pas ce souci sur mon ordinateur portable sous Ubuntu)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:33
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sources obtenues depuis:\n"
msgstr ""

# TRANSLATOR Claude
#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:38
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "git clone https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel-denoise.git\n"
#| "cd ansel-denoise\n"
#| "sh scripts/setup_contributor.sh\n"
msgid ""
"-  git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel.git\n"
"- cd ansel\n"
"-  git submodule init\n"
"-  git submodule update\n"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel-denoise.git\n"
"cd ansel-denoise\n"
"sh scripts/setup_contributor.sh\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:40
#, no-wrap
msgid "Puis mise à jour:\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:43
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"- *cd ~/ansel/ ;git checkout ;git fetch -v ; git pull -v*\n"
"- * cd ~/ansel/ ; rm -rf ./build; mkdir ./build ; cd ./build ; cmake -G Ninja -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release -DBINARY_PACKAGE_BUILD=OFF -DCMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=/opt/ansel ../. ; cmake --build . && cmake --install . && cmake --build . --target package*\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:45
#, no-wrap
msgid "Le fichier C:\\msys64\\home\\phg\\ansel\\build\\CMakeFiles\\CMakeScratch\\TryCompile-c96dm8\\cmTC_a8369.exe a été infecté par Gen:Variant.Tedy.532521. La menace a été bloquée avec succès et votre appareil est sain\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:47
#, no-wrap
msgid "Et suite à ce bloquage de l'anti-virus :\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/building-ansel-on-windows-11-with-msys2.md:49
#, no-wrap
