msgid "This morning I went to the github nightly builds and downloaded ansel-0.0.0+1333.g9242d5a5-win64.exe. When I tried to move the file to my storage directory Windows Defender immediately quarantined the file. Looking further, it reported a trojan embedded in the file. Click on the title of this posting to see a copy of Defender's report.\n"
