#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/trojan-in-latest-release-ansel-0-0-0-1333.md:63
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are 65/70 antivirus that pass clean… https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/b7685065159d284931f8188c1947c37b6dd32d6b5d161ed55536865dc490ca2e\n"
