#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/trojan-in-latest-release-ansel-0-0-0-1333.md:65
#, no-wrap
msgid "But I tested all Ansel versions since 1329, and they all trigger 3 to 5 antiviruses in the pack. It's been seen before…\n"
msgstr ""

