#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/drawn-mask-covers-entire-screen-what-am-i.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "> I'm pretty sure the \"Mask Opacity\" in the upper left is totally unrelated to the \"Mask Opacity\" that's found in \"Mask Refinement\" section of the module (right sidebar).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: content/community/drawn-mask-covers-entire-screen-what-am-i.md:96
#, no-wrap
