#. type: Fenced code block (markdown)
#: content/contribute/website/index.md:199
#, no-wrap
msgid "### My New Heading {#my-old-heading}\n"
msgstr "### Meine neue Überschrift {#mein-alter-anker}\n"

# TRANSLATOR ChatGPT
#. type: Plain text
#: content/contribute/website/index.md:204
#, no-wrap
