# TRANSLATOR Claude
#. type: Title ###
#: content/contribute/workflows.md:24
#, no-wrap
msgid "Developer documentation"
msgstr "Entwicklerdokumentation"

# TRANSLATOR ChatGPT
#. type: Plain text
#: content/contribute/workflows.md:27
#, no-wrap
msgid "The dev docs are [automatically built](https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel/blob/master/.github/workflows/docs.yml) from the source code with Doxygen, every Sunday at 00:00 UTC, then uploaded to <https://dev.ansel.photos>, which is hosted on Github Pages attached to the Ansel (software) repository.\n"
msgstr "Die Entwicklerdokumentation wird [automatisch gebaut](https://github.com/aurelienpierreeng/ansel/blob/master/.github/workflows/docs.yml) aus dem Quellcode mit Doxygen, jeden Sonntag um 00:00 UTC, dann auf <https://dev.ansel.photos> hochgeladen, was auf Github Pages gehostet wird, die an das Ansel (Software) Repository angehängt sind.\n"

# TRANSLATOR Claude
#. type: Title ###
#: content/contribute/workflows.md:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Commits and issues"
msgstr "Commits und Issues"

# TRANSLATOR ChatGPT
#. type: Plain text
